DTSTAMP:20261101T002045Z
DTSTART:20261203T124500Z
DTEND:20261203T150000Z
SUMMARY:Accessible Wellbeing Walks
DESCRIPTION:Free monthly guided walk along an accessible path beside the 
 River Crane. Open to all\, and suitable for wheelchair users and people 
 using walking aids.\nPrice: Free event\nhttps://www.visitrichmond.co.uk/
 events/accessible-wellbeing-walks-p2535801
